messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe reason why a large number of spitters spit at will and without scruples is that the previous punishment measures are far from being a warning and it is more difficult to touch the heart of the spitters. They had no sense of shame when they spited and no shame after being punished.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options does the author think is the best way to punish people who spit everywhere?\n# Options:\nA) We should give them proper guidance.\nB) Touch the depths of their heart.\nC) Not specified.\nD) We need to specify the punishment measures.I think the correct option is: B\n\n<think>\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the context and analyze the options step by step:\n1. The context states that spitters spit at will and without remorse because previous punishment measures were ineffective.\n2. It mentions that spitters had no sense of shame when spitting and no shame after being punished.\n3. The author is looking for a better way to punish these spitters.\nThe correct option is:"]
