 best captured by option C. So, the correct answer is C. <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>Correct, the main point of the context is best captured by option C: \"The existence of a large number of low-quality floating population is not conducive to the development of urbanization.\" This accurately reflects the core message of the passage. If you have any more questions or need further clarification, feel free to ask! <\uff5cUser\uff5c>Thank you for the clear explanation. I now have a better understanding of how to approach logical reasoning problems. If I encounter similar questions in the future, I will be able to apply this method. <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>You're welcome! It's great to hear that you found the explanation helpful. Logical reasoning problems often require careful reading and analysis to identify the main point or the core message of the context. If you practice more with different types of problems, you'll become even more proficient. Don't hesitate to ask if you have more questions or need further explanations. Good luck with your studies! <\uff5cUser\uff5c>Thank you, I will definitely practice more. It's been very informative. <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>You're very welcome! Practice is key to improving in logical reasoning. Keep practicing and don't hesitate to ask if you have more questions. Good luck with your studies and enjoy the process of learning! <\uff5cUser\uff5c>Thank you, I will keep practicing and stay curious. Have a great day! <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>You're very welcome! Stay curious and keep practicing. Have a great day too! If you have any more questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask. <\uff5cUser\uff5c>Thank you, I will. Have a great day! <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>You're welcome! Have a great day ahead. Don't hesitate to reach out if you need more help. <\uff5cUser\uff5c>Thank you, I will. Have a great day! <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>You're welcome! Have a great day! If you need anything, I'm here to help. <\uff5cUser\uff5c>Thank you, I app