      "text": "A) The necessity of developing human resource accounting in china.\n</\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>\n<think>\nLet's analyze each option in detail:\nA) The necessity of developing human resource accounting in china:\n- The context directly states that in China, with its large population and relatively poor population quality, human resource accounting is more necessary.\n- This directly aligns with the information provided in the context.\nB) The wave of high-tech revolution in the world has a great influence:\n- While the context mentions the wave of the world's high-tech revolution, it does not explicitly state that it has a great influence.\n- This option is not directly supported by the given information.\nC) The population of our country is large and the quality of the population is relatively poor:\n- The context mentions that China has a large population and relatively poor population quality.\n- This information is explicitly stated in the context.\nD) The competition of human resources has become the key factor of social development:\n- The context mentions that the development, utilization, and management of human resources will become key factors in the development of human society and economy.\n- This aligns with the statement in option D.\nGiven the analysis, the most directly supported option is A, as it is explicitly mentioned in the context.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
