      "index": 0,
      "text": "B\n\nReasoning:\n- Option A is not the most accurate summary because while it mentions potatoes and rice, it doesn't capture the main reason for the designation.\n- Option B is the most accurate summary. It directly addresses the main point of the passage, which is the importance of global food security.\n- Option C is too specific and doesn't encompass the broader message about food security.\n- Option D is also too specific and doesn't capture the overall message about the significance of potatoes in addressing food security.\nTherefore, the most accurate summary of the passage is Option B: Attention should be paid to the issue of global food security.\n</answer>",
