ciety" as key concepts.\n   - It also talks about "technical training" as a method to support the poor.\n   - This option seems to capture the main themes discussed in the context.\n\n2. **Option B: Precise poverty alleviation, special poverty, typical demonstration**\n   - While "precise poverty alleviation" is mentioned, "special poverty" is not a central theme.\n   - "Typical demonstration" is not mentioned in the context.\n   - This option does not fully represent the main ideas.\n\n3. **Option C: Poor groups, macro background, information society**\n   - "Poor groups" is mentioned, but "macro background" is not discussed.\n   - "Information society" is mentioned, but "poor groups" are not the primary focus.\n   - This option misses the main focus on poverty alleviation and the role of information society.\n\n4. **Option D: Poor groups, special poverty, technical training**\n   - "Poor groups" is mentioned, but "special poverty" is not discussed.\n   - "Technical training" is mentioned, but "special poverty" is not the main focus.\n   - This option also misses the main focus on poverty alleviation and the role of information society.\nThe correct option is:']
