messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nMost people who drink too much will have a headache. If Xiao Wang doesn't drink too much, he probably won't have a headache.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is similar to the above reasoning?\n# Options:\nA) Most greyhounds are easy to train, so xiao wang must have no problem training his new dog\nB) Most domestic cars are very poor, this car is well done, so it may not be domestic\nC) Most famous actors perform very well, because lao gao is not a famous actor, so he may not act well\nD) Most engineers have studied in school for many years, so lao liu may be an engineer because he has studied in school for many yearsI think the correct option is: B\n\n<think>\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the context and the question step by step.\nFirst, let's analyze the context:\n1. Most people who drink too much will have a headache.\n2. If Xiao Wang doesn't drink too much, he probably won't have a headache.\nFrom these statements, we can infer that there is a correlation between drinking too much and having a headache. However, the second statement introduces a conditional probability, suggesting that not drinking too much increases the likelihood of not having a headache, but it doesn't guarantee it.\nThe correct option is:"]
