of Seasons\n10. The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess\n\n### Option Analysis:\n\n**A) Super Mario Bros. is the most popular video game of all time.**\n- Super Mario Bros. is listed as the 1st most popular game. This statement is true based on the information provided.\n\n**B) The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time is the most popular video game of all time.**\n- The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time is listed as the 4th most popular game. This statement is false.\n\n**C) Super Mario Kart is the most popular video game of all time.**\n- Super Mario Kart is listed as the 3rd most popular game. This statement is false.\n\n**D) The Legend of Zelda series is the most popular video game series of all time.**\n- The Legend of Zelda series is represented by multiple games in the list: The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past (2nd), The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time (4th), The Legend of Zelda: Majora's Mask (6th), The Legend of Zelda: Wind Waker (7th), The Legend of Zelda: Oracle of Ages (8th), The Legend of Zelda: Oracle of Seasons (9th), and The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess (10th). Since these games are all part of the same series, and they collectively rank among the top 10 most popular games, this statement is true.\n\n### Conclusion:\nBased on the information provided, the true statement is:\nA) Super Mario Bros. is the most popular video game of all time.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
