ard.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - The prerequisite that must be true for the conclusion to hold is that the driving force of typhoons is the heat generated by sunlight on the surface of sea water. This is because if this is true, then preventing the absorption of sunlight by the clouds would effectively prevent the typhoon from gathering enough energy to move forward.\n\nThe correct option is: D.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
