messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nOn the issue of the selection of the head of the personnel section, a bureau decided to vote by all the staff of the unit. The top three candidates were candidates. Each person only needed to tick the list of employees of the Bureau. The vote counting team found that Zhang Hao, who had just graduated, did not tick anyone; Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie; Li Zilu ticked all those who didn't get the full vote\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, from this it follows that:\n# Options:\nA) Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other\nB) Wang ming and li zilu tick each other\nC) Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming\nD) Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang mingI think the correct option is: C\n\n<think>\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the information provided and analyze each step carefully:\n\n1. **Context Analysis:**\n   - Zhang Hao did not tick anyone.\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.\n\n2. **Implications:**\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he is not included in the list of ticked candidates.\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie. This means if Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming also ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote. This implies that Li Zilu ticked everyone who was not ticked by anyone else.\n\n3. **Identifying Candidates:**\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he is not part of the ticked list.\n   - Let's denote the ticked candidates as A, B, and C (where A, B, and C are the names of the candidates).\n\n4. **Analyzing Wang Ming's Action:**\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie. If Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming also ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - If Zhao Jie was not ticked, Wang Ming did not tick anyone.\n\n5. **Analyzing Li Zilu's Action:**\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote. This means Li Zilu ticked everyone who was not ticked by anyone else.\n   - If Zhao Jie was ticked, Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n   - If Zhao Jie was not ticked, Li Zilu ticked Zhao Jie.\n\n6. **Combining Information:**\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he is not part of the ticked list.\n   - If Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n   - If Zhao Jie was not ticked, Wang Ming did not tick anyone, and Li Zilu ticked Zhao Jie.\n\n7. **Evaluating Options:**\n   - **Option A:** Wang ming and Li zilu didn't tick each other.\n     - This is possible if Zhao Jie was ticked and Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie, but Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n   - **Option B:** Wang ming and Li zilu tick each other.\n     - This is not possible because if Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n   - **Option C:** Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming.\n     - This is not possible because if Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n   - **Option D:** Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang ming.\n     - This is not possible because if Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\nThe correct option is:"]
